    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mule of Graves is a first-person psychological horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Moroccan horror game that offers players an exciting and scary adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story: A person named Ahmed travels by car to his village, but faces a tire explosion near an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When entering the village in search of help, Ahmed finds himself facing terrifying and unexpected scenes, the person tries to understand the curse that has fallen on the place and escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of puzzles and challenges that the player must solve to break the curse and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound effects are strong and scary and sudden jumps add some fear and suspense to the atmosphere, and the game contains more terrifying details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: The game contains psychological horror, scary sounds, scary jumps and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average time to complete the game is 15 minutes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mule of Graves is a first-person psychological horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Moroccan horror game that offers players an exciting and scary adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story: A person named Ahmed travels by car to his village, but faces a tire explosion near an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When entering the village in search of help, Ahmed finds himself facing terrifying and unexpected scenes, the person tries to understand the curse that has fallen on the place and escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of puzzles and challenges that the player must solve to break the curse and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound effects are strong and scary and sudden jumps add some fear and suspense to the atmosphere, and the game contains more terrifying details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: The game contains psychological horror, scary sounds, scary jumps and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average time to complete the game is 15 minutes.</p>",
